s/__init__.py#C:main:before:limit = entry.max_args if entry.max_args is not None else entry.min_args:1\t# Reject surplus positionals instead of silently dropping them.\tPASS\t37\t8\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_commands/__init__.py#C:main:before:from rebar._commands import _confirm:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/__init__.py#C:main:before:from rebar._commands import _confirm:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/__init__.py#C:main:before:from rebar._commands import _confirm:1\t# CLI formats leaf outcomes. Library and MCP calls remain print-free.\tPASS\t36\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_commands/_confirm.py#D:<module>\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/_confirm.py#D:<module>\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/_confirm.py#D:<module>\tCLI mutation confirmations from command outcomes, without store rereads. Global quiet and output flags set a per-invocation context. Text output respects quiet. JSON uses the common mutation envelope unless a verb has an existing JSON shape. Link redirect JSON remains byte-identical.\tPASS\t228\t41\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_commands/_confirm.py#D:extract_global_flags\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/_confirm.py#D:extract_global_flags\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/_confirm.py#D:extract_global_flags\tReturn remaining args, quiet, and output mode. Parse flags only before bare --, preserving later literal data. Output uses the shared parser and defaults to text.\tPASS\t75\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#D:<module>\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#D:<module>\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#D:<module>\tTickets-branch ensure units and their content templates. The store registry calls these idempotent, drift-correcting units on init. Converged units make no commit. init re-exports them for existing callers. Runtime-marker index repair stays in init because it has no template.\tPASS\t228\t39\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#D:_gc_config_unit\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#D:_gc_config_unit\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#D:_gc_config_unit\tKeep automatic garbage collection enabled but in the write lock's foreground. Clear stale gc.auto=0 and set gc.autoDetach and maintenance.autoDetach false. Both auto routes must avoid detached repacking of the shared object database while concurrent writers run. Act only when the tracked configuration differs.\tPASS\t289\t47\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#D:_merge_ours_unit\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#D:_merge_ours_unit\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#D:_merge_ours_unit\tSet the local ours merge driver to true when needed. This makes merge=ours keep the local version of shared root files and lets a converged clone report ok without a write.\tPASS\t77\t32\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#C:_gitignore_unit:before:existing = set(show.stdout.splitlines()):1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#C:_gitignore_unit:before:existing = set(show.stdout.splitlines()):1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py#C:_gitignore_unit:before:existing = set(show.stdout.splitlines()):1\t# Append missing lock and cache ignore lines to older ticket stores.\tPASS\t30\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_comman