pletion verification with bounded insufficiency retries. Keep the same pinned ref and arguments. Return a PASS or final failure. If retried, attach attempt counts, cached PASS counts, and unmet counts. A single-attempt verdict keeps its original shape. Exceptions propagate.\tPASS\t143\t40\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/_commands/close_autoresume.py#C:verify_with_auto_resume:before:phase_started_ns = monotonic_ns():1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/_commands/close_autoresume.py#C:verify_with_auto_resume:before:phase_started_ns = monotonic_ns():1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/_commands/close_autoresume.py#C:verify_with_auto_resume:before:phase_started_ns = monotonic_ns():1\t# Verify this ticket against its immutable local ref without fetching. # Descendants have separate close gates. The attested source permits a # signature. The standalone graph and local-source options remain available.\tPASS\t213\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792814493980116551,"uuid":"66c00206-abec-4fe5-bb3c-0132e6aa7ca1"}